# Modern Developer Portfolio

A high-performance, accessible, and responsive developer portfolio built with **Next.js (App Router)**, **TypeScript**, and **Tailwind CSS**. Designed to showcase production-grade projects, quantifiable technical competencies, and clean architectural boundaries.

---

## ⚡ Tech Stack

- **Framework:** [Next.js](https://nextjs.org/) (App Router, React Server Components)
- **Language:** [TypeScript](https://www.typescriptlang.org/) (Strict type-checking)
- **Styling:** [Tailwind CSS](https://tailwindcss.com/)
- **Deployment:** [Vercel](https://vercel.com/)
- **Package Manager:** npm / pnpm

---

## 🚀 Features

- **Semantic HTML5 & Accessibility:** Screen-reader friendly hierarchy (`<header>`, `<main>`, `<section>`, `<article>`, `<footer>`) with explicit ARIA labels.
- **Measurable Skills Section:** Technical stack categorized by proficiency and real-world usage context rather than arbitrary progress percentages.
- **Responsive Project Grid:** Fully responsive cards showcasing key metrics, system tags, live preview links, and source code repository triggers.
- **Type-Safe Data Layer:** Projects and competencies decoupled into structured TypeScript models (`src/data/`) for seamless content updates.
- **Fast Core Web Vitals:** Static rendering, optimized asset loading, and zero layout shifts.

---

## 📁 Repository Structure

```text
├── public/                 # Static assets (images, icons, resume PDF)
├── src/
│   ├── app/
│   │   ├── globals.css     # Tailwind directives and baseline CSS
│   │   ├── layout.tsx      # Root layout, fonts, and OpenGraph metadata
│   │   └── page.tsx        # Main entry page assembling semantic sections
│   ├── components/
│   │   ├── Contact.tsx     # Semantic contact channels (Email, LinkedIn, GitHub)
│   │   ├── Footer.tsx      # Colophon and repository details
│   │   ├── Hero.tsx        # Intro elevator pitch and quick actions
│   │   ├── Navbar.tsx      # Accessible navigation bar
│   │   ├── ProjectCard.tsx # Self-contained article element for individual projects
│   │   ├── Projects.tsx    # Responsive grid layout wrapper
│   │   └── Skills.tsx      # Grouped competency tables
│   ├── data/
│   │   ├── projects.ts     # Project dataset (links, descriptions, tags, metrics)
│   │   └── skills.ts       # Structured skills and proficiencies
│   └── types/
│       └── index.ts        # Central TypeScript models and contracts
├── tailwind.config.ts      # Theme styling configuration
├── tsconfig.json           # Compiler rules & path aliases (@/*)
└── package.json